ausible while duplicate keys or","startMs":28140,"endMs":32160},{"text":"lost records invalidate the whole migration.","startMs":32160,"endMs":35820},{"text":"A research synthesis is our third case.","startMs":35820,"endMs":38700},{"text":"An unsupported claim can become the premise for later","startMs":38700,"endMs":41460},{"text":"sections.","startMs":41460,"endMs":42860},{"text":"These examples share a dependency problem: later work inherits","startMs":42860,"endMs":46800},{"text":"the quality of intermediate results.","startMs":46800,"endMs":49500},{"text":"Their timings and success rates are illustrative, not measured","startMs":49500,"endMs":52740},{"text":"model benchmarks.","startMs":52740,"endMs":53480},{"text":"Our governing question is: where should a long task","startMs":53480,"endMs":57400},{"text":"earn the right to continue?","startMs":57400,"endMs":59620},{"text":"We will examine a simple probability model, its limits,","startMs":59620,"endMs":63560},{"text":"the effect of checking and correction, and the evidence","startMs":63560,"endMs":66400},{"text":"a useful checkpoint must preserve.","startMs":66400,"endMs":68940},{"text":"The aim is to locate errors while their causes","startMs":68940,"endMs":71360},{"text":"are still understandable.","startMs":71360,"endMs":73340},{"text":"By the end, you should be able to challenge","startMs":73340,"endMs":75340},{"text":"a reliability claim, select an intermediate check, and design","startMs":75340,"endMs":79160},{"text":"a comparison that includes failed and inconclusive runs.","startMs":79160,"endMs":82160}],"boardEvents":[{"atMs":0,"actionIndex":0},{"atMs":0,"actionIndex":1},{"atMs":25680,"actionIndex":2},{"atMs":35820,"actionIndex":3},{"atMs":53480,"actionIndex":4},{"atMs":69640,"actionIndex":5}],"boardTimingMethod":"authored-spoken-cues-v1"}